It is morning in my new flat.
I open the fridge.
It is almost empty.
The cupboards in the kitchen are also empty.
It is time to go grocery shopping.
I sit down at the table.
I write a shopping list.
On the list I write: milk, bread, and cheese.
I also write fruit and vegetables.
It is my first big grocery run in Denmark.
I look out of the window.
It is cold today.
I put on my warm jacket.
I take two cloth bags.
Now I am ready.
I head out the door.
